: flash2-wait ( -- ) begin flash2-status 1 and 0= until ; \ until a program or erase is done  ok.
: flash2-wren ( -- ) 6 flash2-on flash2-off ;     \ write enable, before every program and erase  ok.
: flash2-id ( -- )                                \ JEDEC ID: EF Winbond, 40, then the size  ok.
  $9F flash2-on  0 >flash2> hex. 0 >flash2> hex. 0 >flash2> hex.  flash2-off ;  ok.
: flash2-read ( a addr u -- )                     \ u bytes from the flash at a to memory at addr  ok.
  rot 3 flash2-on >flash2-addr  ok.
  0 ?do 0 >flash2> over i + c! loop drop flash2-off ;  ok.
: flash2-write ( addr u a -- )                    \ u bytes to the flash at a, within one 256-byte page  ok.
  flash2-wren 2 flash2-on >flash2-addr  ok.
  0 ?do dup i + c@ >flash2> drop loop drop flash2-off flash2-wait ; \ it programs when CS goes high  ok.
: flash2-erase ( a -- )                           \ the 4 KB sector around a, back to FF  ok.
  flash2-wren $20 flash2-on >flash2-addr flash2-off flash2-wait ; \ takes about 45 ms  ok.
  ok.
: flash2-init ( -- )  ok.
  1 1 lshift $4002104C bis!                       \ RCC AHB2ENR: clock for GPIOB  ok.
  1 14 lshift $40021058 bis!                      \ RCC APB1ENR1: clock for SPI2  ok.
  flash2-off                                      \ CS high before it becomes an output  ok.
  %11 flash2-cs-pin 2* lshift flash2-cs-port bic! \ MODER: clear the two bits  ok.
  %01 flash2-cs-pin 2* lshift flash2-cs-port bis! \ MODER: 01 = output  ok.
  1 flash2-cs-pin lshift flash2-cs-port 4 + bic!  \ OTYPER: push-pull  ok.
  %11 flash2-clk-pin 2* lshift flash2-clk-port bic! \ MODER: clear the two bits  ok.
  %10 flash2-clk-pin 2* lshift flash2-clk-port bis! \ MODER: 10 = alternate function  ok.
  1 flash2-clk-pin lshift flash2-clk-port 4 + bic! \ OTYPER: push-pull  ok.
  $F flash2-clk-pin 8 - 4 * lshift flash2-clk-port $24 + bic! \ AFRH: clear the four bits  ok.
  flash2-clk-af flash2-clk-pin 8 - 4 * lshift flash2-clk-port $24 + bis! \ AFRH: AF5 = SPI2 SCK  ok.
  %11 flash2-di-pin 2* lshift flash2-di-port bic! \ MODER: clear the two bits  ok.
  %10 flash2-di-pin 2* lshift flash2-di-port bis! \ MODER: 10 = alternate function  ok.
  1 flash2-di-pin lshift flash2-di-port 4 + bic!  \ OTYPER: push-pull  ok.
  $F flash2-di-pin 8 - 4 * lshift flash2-di-port $24 + bic! \ AFRH: clear the four bits  ok.
  flash2-di-af flash2-di-pin 8 - 4 * lshift flash2-di-port $24 + bis! \ AFRH: AF5 = SPI2 MOSI  ok.
  %11 flash2-do-pin 2* lshift flash2-do-port bic! \ MODER: clear the two bits  ok.
  %10 flash2-do-pin 2* lshift flash2-do-port bis! \ MODER: 10 = alternate function  ok.
  1 flash2-do-pin lshift flash2-do-port 4 + bic!  \ OTYPER: push-pull  ok.
  $F flash2-do-pin 8 - 4 * lshift flash2-do-port $24 + bic! \ AFRH: clear the four bits  ok.
  flash2-do-af flash2-do-pin 8 - 4 * lshift flash2-do-port $24 + bis! \ AFRH: AF5 = SPI2 MISO  ok.
  $1700 flash2-spi 4 + !                          \ CR2: 8-bit frames, RXNE after one byte (FRXTH)  ok.
  $354 flash2-spi ! ;                             \ CR1: master, SCK = 16 MHz / 8, SSM and SSI (CS is a GPIO), on  ok.
